   Garay-Alvarez, Alba and Pavan, Maria Florencia and Molina, Rafael and
   Munoz, Ines G. and Grossi, Julian and Noguera, Martin and Vila,
   Antonella and Garcia, Augusto E. and Gentili, Hernan G. and Rodriguez,
   Naira Antonia and Aran, Martin and Parreno, Viviana and Bok, Marina and
   Hermoso, Juan A. and Ibanez, Lorena Itati and Santos, Javier},
Title = {Nanobodies as tools for studying human frataxin biology},
